[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15002.309, "timestamp": "04:10:02", "text": "An正在玩《空夜》。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15007.349, "timestamp": "04:10:07", "text": "总之，呃，我们添加了两个 yori 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15009.189, "timestamp": "04:10:09", "text": "大多数语言都源自梵语，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15016.309, "timestamp": "04:10:16", "text": "嗯，意思是请。 啊，明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15020.07, "timestamp": "04:10:20", "text": "所以我们收到了两首Yari Kaki的歌。 好久不见了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15022.79, "timestamp": "04:10:22", "text": "。 它们真的好长啊兄弟。 我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15024.309, "timestamp": "04:10:24", "text": "天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15028.79, "timestamp": "04:10:28", "text": "它比那首情歌长得多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15032.71, "timestamp": "04:10:32", "text": "苏琪·达卡拉. 不，不，不，等等。 这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15034.87, "timestamp": "04:10:34", "text": "长度，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15037.83, "timestamp": "04:10:37", "text": "这个长度让我想起了这个，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15042.229, "timestamp": "04:10:42", "text": "长度简直就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15045.75, "timestamp": "04:10:45", "text": "这首歌一样。 我不认为Suki有这么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15049.269, "timestamp": "04:10:49", "text": "长。 是的。 所以和 Suki 以及那首"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15054.63, "timestamp": "04:10:54", "text": "关于啤酒避孕套的歌很像，还有那首关于"}]